  "question": {
    "text": "Between the following two statements:\nStatement I : Let $\\vec{a}=\\hat{i}+2 \\hat{j}-3 \\hat{k}$ and $\\vec{b}=2 \\hat{i}+\\hat{j}-\\hat{k}$. Then the vector $\\vec{r}$ satisfying $\\vec{a} \\times \\vec{r}=\\vec{a} \\times \\vec{b}$ and $\\vec{a} \\cdot \\vec{r}=0$ is of magnitude $\\sqrt{10}$.<br />Statement II : In a triangle $A B C, \\cos 2 A+\\cos 2 B+\\cos 2 C \\geq-\\frac{3}{2}$.",
